{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"巴基斯坦成功試射首枚國產空對空導彈\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/PAK-MISSILE-261104-07.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】巴基斯坦宣布，成功試射首枚國產空對空導彈。</p><p>巴基斯坦軍方發放片段，顯示JF-17雷電戰機升空，並成功試射該枚國產空對空導彈。巴基斯坦軍方表示，導彈配備先進的末端制導系統，可在更遠距離攔截敵方空中目標。</p><p>巴基斯坦總統扎爾達里及陸軍參謀長穆尼爾就導彈成功試射表示祝賀。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T23:41:29.564987+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":140,"images":1,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T23:26:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T16:38:28.088655+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T23:38:36.444601+00:00","content_hash":"1fffe2535bfddc50659db8b9d63319541f840272fab3036a6f615d0690c9e5bf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T23:41:29.564987+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}